  "content": "<div>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>✨ 红石微调</strong></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/jMhlv0AnTmg?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Redstone Tweaks 是一款采用原版风格的资源包，旨在提升您的红石体验。它使多个隐藏的方块状态可见，并在物品栏中添加了实用的图表等功能！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>🛠️ 自定义设置</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Redstone Tweaks 现已完全支持 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frespackopts\" rel=\"nofollow\">ResPackOpts</a>，允许您根据需要切换功能并调整每一个细节。您可以在我的 YouTube 频道上查看 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fiJObRPuR6Bs\" rel=\"nofollow\">说明视频</a>，了解所有您需要知道的内容！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>❤️ 喜欢这个资源包？</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">在创建 Redstone Tweaks 的过程中，我投入了大量的热情和精力。因此，如果您决定在我的在线内容（如 YouTube 视频、Twitch 直播等）中使用它，如果能给我一个鸣谢或简短提及，我将不胜感激。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"> 如果您想支持我，只需将以下文本粘贴到您的描述中：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">资源包：Redstone Tweaks by RexxStone</span><br><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fredstone-tweaks%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/redstone-tweaks/</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>🙏🏻 致谢与特别感谢</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Redstone Tweaks 是一个庞大的项目！自然，我借鉴了一些灵感，并使用了其他创作者的纹理、模型和方块状态文件。快去看看吧！</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvanillatweaks.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanilla Tweaks</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fbeatso%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Beatso</a> (<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252flittle-improvements-redstone%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">小小改进：红石</a>)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fcreativity_shark%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">CreativityShark</a> (<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fvisual-sensors%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">可视化传感器</a>)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@metamilo\" rel=\"nofollow\">metamilo</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fKikuGie\" rel=\"nofollow\">KikuGie</a> (初始 ResPackOpts 配置)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">基于 Mojang Studios 的原始纹理</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">特别感谢我的 Discord 管理员 Junq 在部分纹理制作上提供的帮助！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">如需了解各个纹理和模型的更多信息，请查看资源包内的 \"credits.txt\" 文件。</span></p>\n</div>",
